  {
   "id": "b11-text-9",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 128,
   "width": 690,
   "height": 28,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 71271,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 942561,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The rule: PQ = (extended) P ∩ Q, then lowest cost from S",
   "originalText": "The rule: PQ = (extended) P ∩ Q, then lowest cost from S",
   "fontSize": 22,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b11-text-10",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 166,
   "width": 682,
   "height": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 79190,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1047290,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "PQ  =  extended P-space (B9)  ∩  Q-space (B10)\n\nbest PQ  =  lowest cost from S:   dist(S,Y)          if Y ∈ P(S)\n                                   c(S,N) + dist(N,Y) if Y only in P(N)\n            then lowest router id",
   "originalText": "PQ  =  extended P-space (B9)  ∩  Q-space (B10)\n\nbest PQ  =  lowest cost from S:   dist(S,Y)          if Y ∈ P(S)\n                                   c(S,N) + dist(N,Y) if Y only in P(N)\n            then lowest router id",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b11-text-11",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 276,
   "width": 981,
   "height": 85,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 87109,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1152019,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "•  A PQ node is reached from S without S–E (P) and reaches E without S–E (Q). S tunnels the packet\n   there; the PQ node forwards it normally.\n•  The cost is how S gets in: its own path for a plain-P node, or out through the exit neighbor N (B9).\n•  RFC 7490 §5.2.2 RECOMMENDS lowest cost S → P, then lowest node id (D17 replaced D11’s older rule).",
   "originalText": "•  A PQ node is reached from S without S–E (P) and reaches E without S–E (Q). S tunnels the packet\n   there; the PQ node forwards it normally.\n•  The cost is how S gets in: its own path for a plain-P node, or out through the exit neighbor N (B9).\n•  RFC 7490 §5.2.2 RECOMMENDS lowest cost S → P, then lowest node id (D17 replaced D11’s older rule).",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b11-text-12",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 371,
   "width": 373,
   "height": 24,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 95028,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1256748,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Example 4 in full (from the engine)",
   "originalText": "Example 4 in full (from the engine)",
   "fontSize": 19,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b11-text-13",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 405,
   "width": 702,
   "height": 75,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 102947,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1361477,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Extended P(PE1) = {P2, P4} ∪ {PE2 via P2}   (B8, B9)\nQ(P1)           = {P3, PE2}                  (B10)\nPQ              = {PE2}\nCost            = c(PE1,P2) + dist(P2,PE2) = 10 + 20 = 30, sent out through P2",
   "originalText": "Extended P(PE1) = {P2, P4} ∪ {PE2 via P2}   (B8, B9)\nQ(P1)           = {P3, PE2}                  (B10)\nPQ              = {PE2}\nCost            = c(PE1,P2) + dist(P2,PE2) = 10 + 20 = 30, sent out through P2",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b11-text-14",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 490,
   "width": 330,
   "height": 24,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 110866,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1466206,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Choosing when there are several",
   "originalText": "Choosing when there are several",
   "fontSize": 19,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b11-text-15",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 524,
   "width": 684,
   "height": 150,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 118785,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1570935,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Example        PQ nodes       Cost from S                     Best\n-------------  -------------  ------------------------------  -------------\n2  ring        {B, C}         B: dist(S,B) = 2                B\n                              C: via A, 1 + 2 = 3\n8  S–E         {B, C}         B: via N, 2 + 3 = 5             B  (link mode)\n                              C: via N, 2 + 6 = 8\n4  PE1–P1      {PE2}          PE2: via P2, 10 + 20 = 30       PE2\n3  ring, B–C   {}             P {A, B} and Q {C} don’t meet   none → TI-LFA",
   "originalText": "Example        PQ nodes       Cost from S                     Best\n-------------  -------------  ------------------------------  -------------\n2  ring        {B, C}         B: dist(S,B) = 2                B\n                              C: via A, 1 + 2 = 3\n8  S–E         {B, C}         B: via N, 2 + 3 = 5             B  (link mode)\n                              C: via N, 2 + 6 = 8\n4  PE1–P1      {PE2}          PE2: via P2, 10 + 20 = 30       PE2\n3  ring, B–C   {}             P {A, B} and Q {C} don’t meet   none → TI-LFA",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b11-text-16",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 684,
   "width": 834,
   "height": 20,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 126704,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1675664,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Step 2 (lowest router id) needs two PQ nodes at the same cost. None of the examples has that.",
   "originalText": "Step 2 (lowest router id) needs two PQ nodes at the same cost. None of the examples has that.",
   "fontSize": 16,
