   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Sources: docs/02-algorithms.md §3, §6  ·  docs/learn/05-remote-lfa.md (PQ nodes, Which PQ node?)  ·  examples/04-isp-core.yaml, 02-ring5.yaml, 03-ring5-highmetric.yaml,\n08-node-protection.yaml  ·  checked with computeForSource()",
